shigley10:es-0043 a ev:EvidenceSpan ;
    rdfs:label "shigley10-es-0043" ;
    ev:blockIdentifier "shigley10/p414/b1" ;
    ev:boundingBox "196.5,98.35,547.01,230.56" ;
    ev:extractedText "the shaft analysis by ignoring the steady compressive stresses due to the press fit. There is, however, a stress concentration effect in the shaft bending stress near the ends of the hub, due to the sudden change from compressed to uncompressed material. The design of the hub geometry, and therefore its uniformity and rigidity, can have a significant effect on the specific value of the stress-concentration factor, making it difficult to report generalized values. For first …"@en ;
    ev:extractionConfidence 0.95 ;
    ev:extractionMethod "pymupdf-textdict+anchor-verified" ;
